WEBVTT

00:37.520 --> 00:39.479
Hurry and hide inside!

00:39.480 --> 00:41.020
Thank you!

00:43.610 --> 00:45.069
Wh-What?!

00:45.070 --> 00:47.029
What is going on...?

00:47.030 --> 00:48.529
Galilea...

00:48.530 --> 00:51.120
Yeah, looks like it started.

00:51.530 --> 00:54.579
What an unexpected worst-case scenario.

00:54.580 --> 00:57.450
No, I'm sure this is all within...

01:01.290 --> 01:02.990
...Prince Lloyd's expectation.

01:12.890 --> 01:17.640
I WAS REINCARNATED AS THE 7TH PRINCE SO I CAN TAKE
MY TIME PERFECTING MY MAGICAL ABILITY 2ND SEASON

02:34.010 --> 02:34.839
A COUPLE OF DAYS AGO

02:34.840 --> 02:36.510
A COUPLE OF DAYS AGO
Big Sis Saria...

02:36.950 --> 02:40.309
Can I participate as an opener
for your recital?

02:40.310 --> 02:43.020
I would love to sing too!

02:46.300 --> 02:47.769
Oh?

02:47.770 --> 02:50.649
What's with the sudden heartwarming stuff?

02:50.650 --> 02:54.399
We're in a serious discussion
of how to protect the Pope...

02:54.400 --> 02:56.029
Don't worry.

02:56.030 --> 02:58.949
It's not like there will be
an assault or assassination here.

02:58.950 --> 03:02.370
Besides, I wouldn't be much help
as a guard either.

03:03.910 --> 03:05.460
True...

03:07.790 --> 03:11.170
It would be safer to have
Lloyd at Daen Cathedral.

03:12.840 --> 03:15.459
Please do! I'd love to sing together!

03:15.460 --> 03:17.470
In that case, we need preparations.

03:17.970 --> 03:20.010
I shall help.

03:21.930 --> 03:25.640
What was that all about?
You didn't sound like yourself.

03:26.560 --> 03:27.689
Oh, that?

03:27.690 --> 03:32.689
I just thought that the culprit
was the Pope himself.

03:32.690 --> 03:35.649
Do you have any basis
for that deduction?!

03:35.650 --> 03:38.449
Elementary, my dear Jihriel.

03:38.450 --> 03:41.449
After all, he seems like
he has a lot of free time.

03:41.450 --> 03:42.859
You can't make that lab

03:42.860 --> 03:45.619
I SURE HAVE A LOT OF FREE TIME!
without tons of time and money, right?

03:45.620 --> 03:47.960
OKAY, LET'S MAKE SOME CHIMERAS!
A very elementary deduction indeed!

03:48.320 --> 03:52.960
So, I'm going to wait until things
start happening at the festival.

03:53.320 --> 03:56.220
You guys should get
some rest while you can.

03:59.760 --> 04:00.830
Practice!

04:01.830 --> 04:03.720
Whaat?!

04:05.810 --> 04:08.729
EPISODE 20: INVASION

04:08.730 --> 04:13.189
That's right, Prince Lloyd will do something
about the cause of all this...

04:13.190 --> 04:13.859
RUMBLE

04:13.860 --> 04:15.469
RUMBLE
Protect the town no matter what!

04:15.470 --> 04:16.490
RUMBLE
Yes!

04:24.660 --> 04:29.290
How can you claim to be nothing
but an ordinary prince?

04:37.590 --> 04:40.049
He cut through Master Lloyd's Luxa!

04:40.050 --> 04:42.990
How is he still moving around after that?!

04:45.850 --> 04:47.099
Let's go, Jihriel!

04:47.100 --> 04:50.770
We'll handle those chimeras,
and return to Master Lloyd right away!

04:51.310 --> 04:53.050
What? But...

04:54.480 --> 04:58.819
Master Lloyd is venting his anger.
Does he really need help?

04:58.820 --> 05:01.070
Of course he would be angry.

05:01.570 --> 05:04.119
There's no way he wouldn't be mad.

05:04.120 --> 05:07.949
After everything that has been done
and is currently happening.

05:07.950 --> 05:11.919
Master Lloyd sees the potential
for sorcery in everybody.

05:11.920 --> 05:14.709
Now that his research ground
is being destroyed,

05:14.710 --> 05:16.209
of course he would be angry.

05:16.210 --> 05:18.129
T-Then there's no need to worry...

05:18.130 --> 05:19.510
It's why we should worry!

05:19.970 --> 05:23.470
He also sees the potential
in Pope Guitane as well!

05:23.970 --> 05:27.220
Anyway, we'll deal with the chimeras
and go back right away!

05:30.230 --> 05:33.229
That single attack
took away all my doubts.

05:33.230 --> 05:38.950
I'm not even interested
in Jihriel or Charles anymore.

05:39.700 --> 05:40.990
A God...

05:41.990 --> 05:44.990
You are a God, and I will vanquish you.

05:45.430 --> 05:48.240
With that, the abyss within me
will be complete.

05:48.760 --> 05:52.250
Fine, think whatever you want.
You're wrong, though.

05:56.130 --> 05:57.010
Come.

06:02.840 --> 06:04.260
That's Crow's bird.

06:04.890 --> 06:06.050
That signal is...

06:12.770 --> 06:14.190
Three caws...

06:14.810 --> 06:17.690
Then the Pope is the culprit!
The worst-case scenario!

06:18.190 --> 06:21.490
But that also means
Lloyd's predictions were right.

06:21.940 --> 06:23.500
Evacuate to the church!

06:24.910 --> 06:29.159
But that doesn't mean
all the other bishops are innocent.

06:29.160 --> 06:31.000
Some might be accomplices.

06:31.580 --> 06:33.500
Bishop Dante...

06:34.080 --> 06:35.630
His stitches...

06:36.890 --> 06:39.999
How suspicious.
He looks like the chimeras!

06:40.000 --> 06:41.550
Cleanse!

06:42.380 --> 06:44.169
Thank you very much.

06:44.170 --> 06:46.680
Umm, Bishop...

06:49.640 --> 06:53.769
Oh dear sweet pea! Don't worry,
this old man will protect you!

06:53.770 --> 06:55.059
POISON PUNCH!
Poison Punch!

06:55.060 --> 06:55.770
POISON PUNCH!

06:57.730 --> 07:01.000
Oh no! I was so creeped out,
I punched without thinking!

07:02.110 --> 07:05.239
It's fine! I'll never wash
my face again!

07:05.240 --> 07:07.280
You have to! It's poisoned!

07:18.250 --> 07:21.749
Wh-What is the meaning of this?!

07:21.750 --> 07:23.760
Bishop Anastasia?!

07:24.300 --> 07:29.259
Oh dear, I was trying to lop your head off
in the commotion.

07:29.260 --> 07:33.769
Isn't it unbecoming of a Bishop
to be carrying weapons?

07:33.770 --> 07:36.889
THE POPE'S FORCES, LUNAR PRIESTESS ANASTASIA
True. I'll just quit, then.

07:36.890 --> 07:39.270
THE POPE'S FORCES, LUNAR PRIESTESS ANASTASIA
Seems I was right to be here...

07:50.660 --> 07:52.409
That one in the middle...

07:52.410 --> 07:55.040
It's obvious that it has
an abnormal amount of mana!

07:56.270 --> 07:57.799
THE POPE'S FORCE, A-RANK CHIMERA,
I am Grimoire, the Forbidden Tome!

07:57.800 --> 07:59.039
GRIMOIRE, THE FORBIDDEN TOME (?)
I am Grimoire, the Forbidden Tome!

07:59.040 --> 08:00.459
What?!

08:00.460 --> 08:02.039
It can't be...!

08:02.040 --> 08:05.339
Wait, Grimoire? That?

08:05.340 --> 08:09.049
Fool! Do you not know what he is?!
Youngsters these days!

08:09.050 --> 08:12.929
He is the legendary demon
that brought destruction

08:12.930 --> 08:15.599
to the Saloum Kingdom
before he was sealed away!

08:15.600 --> 08:21.060
When I was young, my parents said Grimoire
would come to torment naughty children!

08:21.650 --> 08:24.569
I can't believe it!
He's been released from his seal!

08:24.570 --> 08:26.609
If a kid is being naughty...

08:26.610 --> 08:28.780
Then Grimoire will come...

08:30.240 --> 08:31.280
I'm here.

08:34.370 --> 08:40.650
Indeed! And now, I shall have my vengeance
on the kingdom that has imprisoned me!

08:42.250 --> 08:44.250
Greyyy?!

08:50.680 --> 08:52.300
Hey, Mumbles!

08:52.890 --> 08:57.640
Setting ourselves as bait is one thing,
but what now?!

08:58.100 --> 09:00.850
I wonder if it was a good idea
to leave the church...?

09:01.210 --> 09:02.480
Listen to me!

09:02.930 --> 09:06.729
That old Melissa is staying at the church!
They'll absolutely be fine!

09:06.730 --> 09:08.109
She doesn't look like much,

09:08.110 --> 09:11.239
- but she's one heck of a hag with magic powers!
- There's no need to worry.

09:11.240 --> 09:14.489
She's nowhere as awesome as I,
Bishop Batts, though!

09:14.490 --> 09:16.119
I said listen!

09:16.120 --> 09:20.889
The messenger birds are acting weird,
especially the ones in the city center.

09:20.890 --> 09:22.790
Something terrible might be happening.

09:28.630 --> 09:30.520
Dang, he's quite something...

09:35.430 --> 09:38.599
I don't care if you're
the Second Prince's subordinate or what,

09:38.600 --> 09:41.140
I don't trust you people yet...

09:42.900 --> 09:46.650
THE POPE'S FORCE, SS-RANK CHIMERA,
NETHER-BEAST, BLACK DRAGON CHIMERA

09:49.940 --> 09:50.950
Hey...

09:51.570 --> 09:52.660
Hey...!

09:53.070 --> 09:55.050
What the heck is that?!

09:56.780 --> 09:59.410
Mumbles, just what is...

10:03.000 --> 10:04.540
Are you kidding me?

10:05.960 --> 10:09.050
He jumped straight toward that beast...

10:09.530 --> 10:11.330
...without a shred of hesitation!

10:11.920 --> 10:15.679
Batts, a man doesn't run off their mouth.

10:15.680 --> 10:18.310
They talk with their back.

10:18.930 --> 10:22.309
I hear it, Dante!

10:22.310 --> 10:27.940
I can hear a great rocking shout
from Mumbles' back!

10:29.440 --> 10:34.200
I'm a step closer to becoming
an awesomer Bishop!

10:39.410 --> 10:42.040
I WAS REINCARNATED AS THE 7TH PRINCE SO I CAN TAKE
MY TIME PERFECTING MY MAGICAL ABILITY 2ND SEASON

10:44.540 --> 10:47.040
AOMAKI - AKAMAKI

10:47.960 --> 10:49.040
An instant.

10:49.670 --> 10:54.550
Time flows slowly, like falling petals.

10:55.550 --> 10:57.679
The enemy standing in my way

10:57.680 --> 11:01.060
is given time to look back
at their whole life.

11:01.600 --> 11:04.560
An illusion that time flows
five centimeters per second.

11:04.950 --> 11:06.900
When in reality...

11:09.400 --> 11:12.939
They're dropped at subsonic speed
without being able to brace themselves!

11:12.940 --> 11:14.450
AOMAKI - AKAMAKI

11:16.450 --> 11:17.950
Did you enjoy it?

11:19.950 --> 11:24.870
Seeing your transient life
scatter like cherry blossoms?

11:26.290 --> 11:29.749
My Rakkaken kills in a single hit!

11:29.750 --> 11:31.500
THE POPE'S FORCE, A-RANK CHIMERA,
SHAKRA, FISTS OF THE FALLING FLOWERS

11:33.260 --> 11:35.910
Wh-What just happened?!

11:37.720 --> 11:43.100
Even my untrained eyes can see that
the Bunhead unleashed a fierce attack...

11:43.640 --> 11:48.269
That thing must've restrained her
with its six arms...

11:48.270 --> 11:49.940
They then blurred into one...

11:50.730 --> 11:53.939
...and the next moment,
she's plunged deep into the ground!

11:53.940 --> 11:55.359
Bunhead!

11:55.360 --> 11:57.199
Hey, are you all right?!

11:57.200 --> 12:03.199
It's futile. I told you,
the Rakkaken kills in one hit.

12:03.200 --> 12:07.710
You two just made me
repeat the things I've said.

12:08.290 --> 12:09.329
Besides, why do you two have the same face?

12:09.330 --> 12:11.709
GULP. WELL, I MEAN, WE'RE TWINS, AFTER ALL...
Besides, why do you two have the same face?

12:11.710 --> 12:13.210
It's redundant.

12:13.710 --> 12:15.709
How irritating...

12:15.710 --> 12:17.720
You will both die in one go!

12:26.140 --> 12:27.099
What?!

12:27.100 --> 12:29.019
- Bunhead!
- Bunhead!

12:29.020 --> 12:31.359
Impossible! You should've died!

12:31.360 --> 12:34.250
Without bracing,
your brain should've gone splat!

12:35.360 --> 12:37.370
But I did brace myself.

12:38.570 --> 12:39.860
Just barely in time.

12:40.320 --> 12:43.000
Glad to have a brittle-looking arm
next to me.

12:44.200 --> 12:47.120
So I tore it off and used it as a cushion.

12:49.580 --> 12:53.630
You could've just peacefully watched
over your life flashing over...

12:54.010 --> 12:57.130
Oh, I did see my life flashing indeed.

12:57.620 --> 12:59.360
Thanks to that, I remember now.

13:01.440 --> 13:04.509
Rakkaken, a style without a single disciple.

13:04.510 --> 13:07.599
A martial art that disappeared
in a single generation.

13:07.600 --> 13:10.849
I'm guessing that inside that chimera body
is the wraith of Shakra,

13:10.850 --> 13:13.110
the founder of Rakkaken, correct?

13:14.190 --> 13:18.280
My Rakkaken is finally complete
after obtaining this chimera body!

13:18.740 --> 13:22.279
Six eyes that allow me super reaction
beyond human limits!

13:22.280 --> 13:25.029
Six arms that allow me
to restrict all four limbs!

13:25.030 --> 13:27.789
A fatal throw
that does not allow any defenses!

13:27.790 --> 13:29.409
And you dare...

13:29.410 --> 13:31.959
Why do you seek to become stronger?

13:31.960 --> 13:32.770
What?!

13:33.290 --> 13:36.100
- Bunhead...
- Bunhead...

13:37.210 --> 13:38.800
I endured a million strikes...

13:39.190 --> 13:43.259
I punched, punched,
cried, and kept punching.

13:43.260 --> 13:45.800
For whom? For what?

13:46.640 --> 13:48.180
It's so I can become popular.

13:49.390 --> 13:50.600
Ridiculous...

13:51.390 --> 13:55.149
You joined this holy battle
for something so pointless...?

13:55.150 --> 13:56.690
What about you?

13:57.190 --> 14:02.010
Did you take on such a hideous form
for no reason at all?

14:07.990 --> 14:09.659
I won't lose.

14:09.660 --> 14:12.540
Not to someone who has strayed
from their humanity!

14:13.750 --> 14:19.340
Her belief, her qi techniques,
her stance... It must be...

14:19.820 --> 14:21.380
The Hyakkaken!

14:21.920 --> 14:25.719
Should I curse God,
or should I thank them?

14:25.720 --> 14:28.849
To think I would cross paths
with them again...

14:28.850 --> 14:31.849
MARTIAL ART

14:31.850 --> 14:33.850
SHAKRA...

14:37.020 --> 14:40.070
IF YOU FAIL A HUNDRED TIMES,
THEN TRY AGAIN A MILLION TIMES...

14:41.070 --> 14:43.070
How absurd...

14:45.070 --> 14:47.700
DON'T JUST GIVE UP AFTER
YOUR FIRST DEFEAT...

14:48.700 --> 14:51.949
I am rational!

14:51.950 --> 14:55.289
Chimeras are stronger than humans!
Their strong bodies will not age!

14:55.290 --> 14:57.709
It's logical, no matter how you spin it!

14:57.710 --> 15:00.339
And she says that I've strayed?

15:00.340 --> 15:03.469
This girl only lived for a little
more than a decade.

15:03.470 --> 15:05.219
How insolent.

15:05.220 --> 15:08.719
The fool. Is she planning
to come straight at me again?

15:08.720 --> 15:11.970
The fool. I will catch her.

15:15.600 --> 15:17.230
The fool...

15:20.570 --> 15:22.630
I will kill her.

15:46.970 --> 15:48.509
"Vengeance."

15:48.510 --> 15:53.220
My eyes were filled with petals
falling slowly...

15:53.770 --> 15:56.769
RAKKAKEN

15:56.770 --> 15:59.400
PLEASE, LEARN MY TECHNIQUES...

16:02.020 --> 16:04.280
OTHERWISE, THE RAKKAKEN WILL END HERE!

16:07.030 --> 16:09.530
YOU LOST TO THE HYAKKAKEN, DIDN'T YOU?

16:14.040 --> 16:16.540
JUST GIVE IT UP, OLD MAN

16:18.040 --> 16:20.040
It's all over...

16:20.430 --> 16:24.050
A hundred times, a million times, he said?

16:24.590 --> 16:27.720
All it took was one loss,
and everything is over!

16:28.920 --> 16:30.510
I curse you...

16:35.600 --> 16:40.059
The pain... The hatred... The desire...

16:40.060 --> 16:44.300
Give me the power
to kill my foes in one strike.

16:49.740 --> 16:54.579
Come with me.
I will prepare a worthy vessel.

16:54.580 --> 16:56.449
FOR WHAT?
For what?

16:56.450 --> 16:58.330
FOR WHOM...?
For whom?

16:59.120 --> 17:00.580
To be popular.

17:03.090 --> 17:05.629
This strong blow

17:05.630 --> 17:10.510
brought my consciousness back
from memory lane to reality.

17:17.160 --> 17:20.100
Hundreds of fists came raining down.

17:20.940 --> 17:25.610
But my Rakkaken will not falter,
it won't lose!

17:44.380 --> 17:47.379
You did it, Bunhead!

17:47.380 --> 17:49.799
Take that, you monster!

17:49.800 --> 17:52.000
It was an easy win for...

17:53.390 --> 17:55.020
No...

17:56.140 --> 17:59.390
There's no way that was an easy victory...

17:59.820 --> 18:02.139
She was grappled, and then broke free.

18:02.140 --> 18:04.400
Then she was grappled
and broke free again.

18:05.480 --> 18:07.480
And then she was grappled yet again.

18:08.650 --> 18:11.820
She tore victory
out of the enemy's clutches!

18:13.320 --> 18:18.159
She won against a monster that
simply stitched on what it lacked...!

18:18.160 --> 18:20.749
She gained victory in a human body...!

18:20.750 --> 18:24.710
Thanks to all the hard work
she endured before!

18:25.830 --> 18:28.250
Well...?

18:29.110 --> 18:31.210
Did you see that...

18:32.170 --> 18:35.759
...my Rakkaken...?

18:35.760 --> 18:37.679
It's still speaking!

18:37.680 --> 18:40.019
It must be cleansed!

18:40.020 --> 18:43.020
Yeah. I saw it.

18:44.520 --> 18:47.710
Amazing.
You're still trying to throw me.

18:50.260 --> 18:54.410
You win.
That was an amazing move.

18:55.340 --> 18:58.240
You kept going for it,
without ever giving up.

18:59.000 --> 19:02.440
So full of humanity, and really cool.

19:06.040 --> 19:09.800
I see...

19:12.550 --> 19:14.400
All I ever wanted...

19:14.890 --> 19:19.010
...was for someone to acknowledge me...

19:33.690 --> 19:35.450
Pyrlanse Incinis!

19:36.530 --> 19:39.030
UWAAAH!

19:40.200 --> 19:44.909
Galilea! My powers aren't
working on them at all!

19:44.910 --> 19:46.209
Yeah, no surprise here!

19:46.210 --> 19:50.169
They're basically meat puppets
that don't feel any pain!

19:50.170 --> 19:55.630
Not to mention that goat-head kept healing
itself with its huge stock of mana!

19:56.170 --> 20:00.599
It also uses super-strong spells!
How do we fight it?!

20:00.600 --> 20:03.640
You two bishops, protect the church!

20:04.180 --> 20:09.100
Talia, back me up with Divine Sorcery!
I'll look for a chance to tie it down!

20:13.070 --> 20:14.859
Tie me down?

20:14.860 --> 20:20.240
Do you really think you can do that
to Grimoire, the Forbidden Tome?!

20:21.620 --> 20:24.739
Shut up, you fake!

20:24.740 --> 20:26.619
No, Talia, wait.

20:26.620 --> 20:27.869
What?!

20:27.870 --> 20:30.749
What if our Grim is the fake one?

20:30.750 --> 20:33.089
What are you saying, Galilea?

20:33.090 --> 20:34.840
Our Grim is more...

20:35.840 --> 20:37.630
Hey!

20:38.000 --> 20:41.429
I brought pancakes for you all.

20:41.430 --> 20:43.509
He's asleep.

20:43.510 --> 20:45.139
What a sleepyhead.

20:45.140 --> 20:47.979
He's way more lovely...

20:47.980 --> 20:49.389
Right?

20:49.390 --> 20:52.400
Does that mean this one
is the real deal?

20:52.810 --> 20:54.229
Behold!

20:54.230 --> 21:00.409
The legendary ancient magic of
Grimoire, the Forbidden Tome!

21:00.410 --> 21:02.659
WHACK

21:02.660 --> 21:03.910
- Eh?
- Huh?

21:10.710 --> 21:11.920
Eh?

21:12.880 --> 21:13.920
Wait...

21:14.540 --> 21:15.800
Are you...?

21:18.340 --> 21:19.930
Arctis Obscura.

21:35.190 --> 21:39.490
Oh, come on...
It's not even a demon inside.

21:39.950 --> 21:41.080
Catch.

21:41.530 --> 21:43.570
Go cleanse that thing.

21:45.930 --> 21:50.459
And Galilea, focus on closing up
all the holes around the city.

21:50.460 --> 21:52.210
G-Got it!

21:55.420 --> 21:58.129
So, what are you exactly?

21:58.130 --> 22:03.089
I-I was a sorcerer who was
researching ancient magic.

22:03.090 --> 22:05.679
And I ended up
becoming a fan of Grimoire...

22:05.680 --> 22:06.470
Cleanse.

22:10.850 --> 22:13.480
So, was that...

22:14.190 --> 22:16.980
It can't be...

23:50.700 --> 23:53.949
My Rakkaken will not disappear nor perish!

23:53.950 --> 23:57.169
I entrust it to you,
young girl of Hyakkaken style.

23:57.170 --> 23:59.289
Next time, Episode 21:

23:59.290 --> 24:01.169
EPISODE 21: THE MOON AND THE PORK CUTLET
The Moon and the Pork Cutlet.

24:01.170 --> 24:05.050
EPISODE 21: THE MOON AND THE PORK CUTLET
You will witness the depths of sorcery.
